.TH sam-jail-selftest 1 2026-11-10 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM Manual"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-selftest \- Start sandboxed apps briefly and report which ones keep running. Opens their windows for a few seconds
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail selftest\fR [\fB\-\-seconds\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIAPPS\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Start sandboxed apps briefly and report which ones keep running. Opens their windows for a few seconds
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-seconds\fR \fI<SECONDS>\fR [default: 8]
Seconds to let each app run
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIAPPS\fR]
Apps to test (default: all sandboxed apps)
